<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">3 JOHAN</para>
  <para style="toc1">3 John</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 JOHAN</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Jo</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOHAN</para>
  <para style="mt2">CCAKY KYTHUMNAW</para>
  <para style="mt2">3 John</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Johan Ccaky Kythumnaw hynh</char> “Khriccaaw Piccan” nynh Khriccaaw cciakhaetu Kaias ci hae paw kalan a kypaw nynh thua. Ccawzeitu nynh Kaias kha a luung, pawccecize Kaias nynh ccangpaw Khriccaaw hae a bawmnaw hae te Diotrefes a ci hae paw ccungccapaw kha raeringnaw a pya keiccu nynh athua.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw — 1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Kaias kha thehoysahnaw — 5-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Diotrefes kha thethyasahnaw — 9-10</para>
  <para style="io1">Demetrias kha kawpyanaw — 11-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Athangnaw — 13-15</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kum tang vae paw kae, Johan nynh ka sungsahpaw, byaccing kya kou ka sungsahpaw Kaias, na kalan ccaw kae ky.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Loc 19.29</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16.23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1Ko 1.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka sungsahpaw, pawpaw kya balyn hiinhoyte na um nawlan te na ngedan nawlan saw kae sangpya; na thinlung tuh daebabi lan a um cipaw ka ny. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize nang nynh byaccing kya na hiin thyhawte, uno hae nynh oun thua hae zah na kya umpaw byaccing kong kha ccaekia he a khan hae tuh myarya ka lungtua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ccaaw hae nynh byaccing kya a hiin hae cipaw ka thaepaw lungtuanaw laeze ale huapaw lungtuanaw ka hoi khyh.</para>
  <para style="s">Kaias tungvaw Thehoysahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka sungsahpaw, uno hae hanlan thuasah, abyapihua lante mikhia hae hanlan thuasah rya na lawpya hae paw miakaw kya zyn lan um lante rya na law. <verse number="6" style="v" />Minmin nynh sungsakunaw na hoipaw kong kha khriccaawbuu malang ccaekia a khan hae. Nang nynh minmin kha khua a ccongnaw hae kya Pachia rynaw hawte na saw hae ze, ahoypaw rya na lawpaw athua cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin tuh Khri min hanlan cceih hae zah Zenta hae kyate pawsang mah lawkuh khyh hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aening tuh byaccing rya a lah buapaw ah thua nawlan oh, khahcihawpaw ccungccaw hae kha bawm lan accan.</para>
  <para style="s1">Diotrefes te Demetrias</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khriccaawbuu kalan ccaw syntaraw ka zei vae; thuasalama minmin lakuze lupi huapaw lang tang a rypaw Diotrefes nynh kaening kha kaw oun ua khyh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kamaw he kae thua te, a cyisahnaw kha a liathui nawlan a cyipaw kha ka dianah cih. Aning nynh ahoy leipaw bya te kaening kha sarisarya oun ci, tuh-e te a lungryachih khyh zah uno hae kha mah innccong a ua khyh hae apiaze innccong a ua ry hae paw kha mah khee hae zah khriccaawbuu kyate a dee hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka sungsahpaw, ahoy leipaw kha kaheihlawku leite ahoypaw kha lawkuh. Ahoypaw rya a lahpaw ccungccaw tuh Pachia kya-e nynh thua, ahoy leipaw rya a lahpaw tuh Pachia kha muih khyh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ccungccaw miakaw nynh Demetrias a hoynaw kong kha ccaekia a khan hae, byaccing nynh mah amaw kong kha ccaekia a khan. Kaening nynh mah amaw kong kha ccaekia kae khan, ccaekia kae khanpaw tuh akyh cipaw phe na ny oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyathyakou Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kalan zei lanpaw patae ka hoi ung, thuasalama bawpe te ccatui te ka zei ry vae khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aro maw nang kha kae muih cih zah hawiliakute byahoku lan cite ka ngaehoi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na kya daenaw la um vae sah. Ruiban hae nynh nang kha ae beihlang hae. Ruiban hae kha lu raveihte la beih hae.</para>
</usx>